# TypeScript Standards

- Strict TypeScript — no `any`. Use `unknown` + narrowing when type is uncertain.
- Named exports for components and utilities (no default exports for shared modules).
- Zod for runtime validation at API boundaries; infer types with `z.infer<typeof Schema>`.
- Colocate types with their schemas in `lib/schemas.ts`.
- Minimal scope — smallest correct diff; no drive-by refactors or unrelated changes.
- Match existing naming, import style, and file structure in the surrounding code.
